cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "gghalftone: Halftone, Dither and Line-Screen Fills for ggplot2"
abstract: >-
  Halftone screens as ggplot2 layers. Dots are placed at draw time on a lattice
  with a physical pitch in millimetres, so a figure gets the same screen at any
  output size.
authors:
